# PROJECT: AI-POWERED CURRICULUM DESIGN & UNIVERSITY REVIEW MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

Act as a Senior Full-Stack Developer, AI Engineer, Database Architect, and UI/UX Designer.

I want you to develop a complete, production-ready web application called **AI-Powered Curriculum Design & University Review Management System**.

The application must support multiple universities from one centralized Admin portal. The Admin generates complete academic curricula using AI based on UGC, NEP 2020, NCrF, NHEQF, and applicable university regulations. Each university has its own Reviewer login. Reviewers can access only their assigned university's curricula, review documents, submit comments, upload corrected documents, and approve or request revisions.

IMPORTANT: Build a real, functional, database-connected application. Do not create only static screens or dummy data.

